l compliance scenarios - weaving compliance into science? Hmm. Probably 2.\n\nLet's output JSON with fields.\n\nNeed format: For each subscale, give \"<subscale>_evidence\" (one sentence) first and then \"<subscale>\" integer.\n\nProbably return object with id and fields.\n\nProvide evidence sentence then score.\n\nLet's produce:\n\nid P2790\neffectiveness_evidence: ... \neffectiveness 3\netc.\n\nMake sure one sentence evidence.\n\nProceed.",
